msgstr ""

#: ../../large.rst:198
msgid ""
"The 45-degree cross-grid flight provides the basis for a fully tied together "
"model, while the nadir flights provide the necessary texture for orthophoto "
"texturing. The lower overlap  meets the minimum requirement for orthophoto "
"products as facilitated by by feature matching from the much higher overlap "
"cross-grid."
msgstr ""

