msgstr ""

#: ../../large.rst:203
msgid ""
"For best in class results 2D and 2.5D products and 5cm resolution, it is "
"feasible to collect 2-4km\\ :sup:`2` per person, per day. This requires the "
"following set of flights:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../large.rst:205
#, python-format
msgid "70-80% overlap slightly off-nadir (5-10 degree off nadir)"
msgstr ""

